						"description": "Amounts are in rupees with at most 2 decimals. Ids come from the matching Master > Catalog lists of the transaction's department: set {{departmentId}}, {{branchId}}, {{insurerId}}, {{businessTypeId}}, {{lobId}}, {{agentId}} (and {{productTypeId}} for LI). commission is optional and everything in it is entered by hand: nothing is calculated. GI: odCommission, tpCommission, totalCommission, odCommissionPercent, tpCommissionPercent, totalCommissionPercent and status; LI: amount, percent and status. Amounts are rupees with at most 2 decimals; percentages are 0 to 100 with at most 2 decimals; status is received or pending. Only superadmin, admin, a HOD (own departments) and a commission employee (own entries) may send it; a premium employee gets 403."
